{"ref":"BDB, יְרֻשָּׁה","hw":"יְרֻשָּׁה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְרֻשָּׁה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. (a) possession, inheritance</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.5\">Dt 2:5</a> + 7 times, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרֻשַּׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:17\" href=\"/Judges.21.17\">Ju 21:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:6\" href=\"/Psalms.61.6\">ψ 61:6</a> (but on text v. infr.); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרֻשָּֽׁתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.11\">2 Ch 20:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרֻשָּׁתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.12\">Dt 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.20\">3:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרֻשַּׁתְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:15\" href=\"/Joshua.1.15\">Jos 1:15</a>;—used of land <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.5\">Dt 2:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.9\">9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.19\">19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.20\">3:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ יְרֻשָּׁתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.12\">2:12</a> <em>the land of his possession</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:15\" href=\"/Joshua.1.15\">Jos 1:15</a>; further, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:6\" href=\"/Joshua.12.6\">12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:7\" href=\"/Joshua.12.7\">7</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:17\" href=\"/Judges.21.17\">Ju 21:17</a> (but Bu<sup>RS 152</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁאֲרָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.8\">Je 32:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:6\" href=\"/Psalms.61.6\">ψ 61:6</a> (but < <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֶשֶׁת</span> <em>request</em>, cf. Che<sup>crit. n.</sup>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.11\">2 Ch 20:11</a>.","next":"BDB, רֶ֫שֶׁת","prev":"BDB, יְרוּשָׁא"}